{
  "id": "E204",
  "title": "My Cellphone is Out of Battery",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-03-17",
  "synopsis": "It is important to bring a power bank or cellphone charger when going out.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/691/16e5c916dac46b92f6d31f31109f0f33e7311343.mp3?1521037913",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我的手机没电了\n\n安妮：林红，我的手机没电了，你带充电宝了吗？\n林红：没有，不过我带了充电器。\n安妮：这里能充电吗？\n林红：能，桌子后面有一个插座。\n安妮：太好了！你用的是什么手机？\n林红：iPhone 7，你的呢？ \n安妮：我也是！ 你的充电器能先借我用一下吗？\n林红：当然可以，给你。",
    "traditional": "我的手機沒電了\n\n安妮：林紅，我的手機沒電了，你帶充電寶了嗎？\n林紅：沒有，不過我帶了充電器。\n安妮：這裡能充電嗎？\n林紅：能，桌子後面有一個插座。\n安妮：太好了！你用的是什麼手機？\n林紅：iPhone 7，你的呢？ \n安妮：我也是！ 你的充電器能先借我用一下嗎？\n林紅：當然可以，給你。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "My Cellphone is Out of Battery"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "安妮：林红，我的手机没电了，你带充电宝了吗？",
      "traditional": "安妮：林紅，我的手機沒電了，你帶充電寶了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī lín hóng wǒ de shǒu jī méi diàn le nǐ dài chōng diàn bǎo le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Lin Hong, my cellphone is out of battery. Do you have your power bank with you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "林红：没有，不过我带了充电器。",
      "traditional": "林紅：沒有，不過我帶了充電器。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng méi yǒu bú guò wǒ dài le chōng diàn qì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: No, but I have a charger."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "安妮：这里能充电吗？",
      "traditional": "安妮：這裡能充電嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī zhè lǐ néng chōng diàn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Can I charge my phone here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "林红：能，桌子后面有一个插座。",
      "traditional": "林紅：能，桌子後面有一個插座。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng néng zhuō zi hòu miàn yǒu yí ge chā zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: Yes, there is a power outlet behind the table."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "安妮：太好了！你用的是什么手机？",
      "traditional": "安妮：太好了！你用的是什麼手機？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī tài hǎo le nǐ yòng de shì shén me shǒu jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Great! What kind of cellphone do you have?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "林红：iPhone 7，你的呢？",
      "traditional": "林紅：iPhone 7，你的呢？",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng 3 nǐ de ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": " \n",
      "traditional": " \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: iPhone 7. How about you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "安妮：我也是！ 你的充电器能先借我用一下吗？",
      "traditional": "安妮：我也是！ 你的充電器能先借我用一下嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ yě shì nǐ de chōng diàn qì néng xiān jiè wǒ yòng yí xià ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: So do I. Can I borrow your charger for a while?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "林红：当然可以，给你。",
      "traditional": "林紅：當然可以，給你。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng dāng rán kě yǐ gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: Sure, here you are."
    }
  ],
